# Measurement corpus for the force-state document.
#
# One FEN per line, followed by a comment naming where the position comes from.
# Every position is a real one: a famous game, a published test position, or a
# classical endgame study. The side to move and the clocks are kept for the
# record; they are not part of the configuration and change nothing in the
# force state. Read by core/examples/measure.rs.
#
# --- Reference ---
